Package: cmdstr
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: Smart command storage and recall for the terminal
 cmdstr automatically captures every command you run in the
 terminal, then lets you search, tag, annotate, and browse your
 command history with ease.
 .
 Features:
  - Auto-capture: every command, exit code, duration, and cwd
  - Full-text search with tag and date filtering
  - Tag and annotate commands for easy recall
  - Bookmark your favorites
  - Stats and frequency analysis
  - JSON and CSV export
  - Run tagged commands directly
